        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Webb%2C_Mississippi",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Later, the town was renamed Webb to honor Judge Webb, a prominent local figure.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Webb%2C_Mississippi",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Webb officially incorporated in 1905, establishing its municipal government and formal town status.",
